# Local CI secrets for `act` (used by the global pre-push hook).
#
# THIS REPO NEEDS NO .secrets FILE.
#
# The only push-triggered workflow is test.yml, which references zero
# secrets, so `act push` needs nothing from you here.
#
# ── CLOUD ONLY ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# publish.yml is workflow_run-triggered (it fires after Test passes on
# GitHub), so it never runs under `act push`. It uses:
#   GITHUB_TOKEN        - auto-injected by GitHub; never set manually
#   HOMEBREW_TAP_TOKEN  - a PAT with write access to jackofspade/homebrew-tap,
#                         stored as a repo secret on GitHub
